{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"SCREEN 640,480\nSCREEN SELECT 0\nPARTICLE 1, 10  ; 1=Snow, 20=Densitet\nRASTER 0,0,0,0 ; St\u00E4ng av bakgrundsraster s\u00E5 vi bara ser sn\u00F6n\nDOUBLE BUFFER\n\nRepeat\n  WAIT VBL\nUNTIL KEYSTATE(\u0022Space\u0022)\n\nCLSG 0\nWAIT 500 \n\nPARTICLE 2, 10  ; 1=Rain, 20=Densitet\n\nRepeat\n  WAIT VBL\nUNTIL KEYSTATE(\u0022Space\u0022)\n\nCLSG 0\nWAIT 500 \n\nPARTICLE 3, 10  ; 1=Stars, 20=Densitet\n\nRepeat\n  WAIT VBL\nUNTIL KEYSTATE(\u0022Space\u0022)\n","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}